      "svg": "<svg viewBox='0 0 1100 1100'><rect x='0' y='0' width='1100' height='1100' fill='#1a1a2e'/><text x='550' y='65' font-size='30' fill='#ffd700' text-anchor='middle'>From Awkward Line to Owned Identity</text><rect x='100' y='120' width='900' height='90' rx='12' fill='#ef4444' opacity='0.2' stroke='#ef4444' stroke-width='2'/><text x='550' y='175' font-size='20' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>Week 1: &quot;I intend to submerge the ship&quot; -- feels performative</text><line x1='550' y1='210' x2='550' y2='260' stroke='#ffd700' stroke-width='3'/><rect x='100' y='270' width='900' height='90' rx='12' fill='#f59e0b' opacity='0.2' stroke='#f59e0b' stroke-width='2'/><text x='550' y='325' font-size='20' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>Weeks 2-6: repeated across dozens of routine evolutions</text><line x1='550' y1='360' x2='550' y2='410' stroke='#ffd700' stroke-width='3'/><rect x='100' y='420' width='900' height='90' rx='12' fill='#10b981' opacity='0.2' stroke='#10b981' stroke-width='2'/><text x='550' y='475' font-size='20' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>Later: officers feel different before they can say why</text><line x1='550' y1='510' x2='550' y2='560' stroke='#ffd700' stroke-width='3'/><rect x='150' y='570' width='800' height='120' rx='12' fill='#6366f1' opacity='0.2' stroke='#6366f1' stroke-width='2'/><text x='550' y='620' font-size='21' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>Identity shift: &quot;I am the kind of officer</text><text x='550' y='655' font-size='21' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>who owns this decision&quot;</text><rect x='150' y='740' width='800' height='200' rx='14' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#8b5cf6' stroke-width='2'/><text x='550' y='790' font-size='21' fill='#8b5cf6' text-anchor='middle'>Civilian parallel</text><text x='550' y='830' font-size='19' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>New manager required to run direct,</text><text x='550' y='860' font-size='19' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>scripted feedback one-on-ones</text><text x='550' y='900' font-size='18' fill='#888' text-anchor='middle'>before feeling ready -- comfort follows the repeated act</text></svg>",
      "caption": "The awkward early repetitions are not failure signs; they are the mechanism doing its work."
